{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_184_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_184","textTraditional":"一、三年，春，王正月，丁未，滕子原卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_184_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_184","textTraditional":"二、夏，叔弓如滕。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_184_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_184","textTraditional":"三、五月，葬滕成公。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_184_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_184","textTraditional":"四、秋，小邾子來朝。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_184_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_184","textTraditional":"五、八月，大雩。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_184_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_184","textTraditional":"六、冬，大雨雹。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_184_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_184","textTraditional":"七、北燕伯款出奔齊。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_184_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_184","textTraditional":"其曰北燕，從史文也。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}